<title>GERMANY: Buba says 1996 profit 9.43 billion marks.</title>
<headline>Buba says 1996 profit 9.43 billion marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Thursday that its 1996 annual profit totalled 9.43 billion marks and that it was transferring 8.83 billion marks to the Bonn government.</p>
<p>In 1995 the Bundesbank posted a 10.93 billion-mark profit and transferred 10.32 billion marks to the government.</p>
<p>The government had budgeted for a seven billion-mark transfer and plans to use the rest to retire old debt.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
